[[270,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp</p><p>Ensure that the ignition key is in the\nOFF position, then disconnect the negative battery terminal (-).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Battery</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235044\">A1B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Proceed with removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237704\">1076B18</a></p>"],[270,127,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the intermediate drive shaft (1b)\nby withdrawing from its seat.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017743.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[270,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the intermediate driveshaft back\nin its housing by pushing through the mount.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Take care not to damage the grooved\ncoupling on the differential during assembly.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><p>Tighten the bolts fixing the intermediate\ndriveshaft to the support to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INTERMEDIATE DRIVE SHAFT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Support side) 2.5 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[6,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3237705\">1076B50</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[264,127,0,"<p>Proceed with refitting  \n                                          <a href=\"#/3237704\">1076B18</a></p>"],[270,127,0,"<p><a href=\"#/3238966\">7055B54</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Connect the negative (-) battery terminal</p><p>Remove the car from the ramps.</p>"],[720,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Hand-tighten the upper wishbone nut to\nthe wheel hub knuckle.</p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the intermediate drive shaft (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2017744.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[720,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the intermediate drive shaft and tighten\nthe bolts to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>INTERMEDIATE DRIVE SHAFT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5 - 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the intermediate drive shaft (1b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Collect the manual gearbox and\ndifferential oil that comes out in a suitable container.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2069883.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1024,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Refit the intermediate half shaft in its\nseating and tighten its bolts to the specified torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Refill the manual gearbox and differential\nfluid \n                                          <strong>- 0010T41 MANUAL GEARBOX OIL - Check level and top up, if necessary</strong>\n                                           .</p>"]]